description=After drinking Vanilla Foods Expanded protein shakes, multiply normally awarded Strength and Fitness XP by 10. A 500 mL dose grants 3 game hours; partial drinks scale by actual protein-shake volume, stacking duration up to 3 hours. Stacks once with Project Iron 0.6.0 pre-workout (x20 combined at its default setting). Single-player only.
descriptionzh=饮用Vanilla Foods Expanded蛋白饮料后，正常结算的力量与体格经验再乘10。500毫升提供3游戏小时，分次饮用按实际蛋白饮料量增加时间，上限3小时；支持 Project Iron 0.6.0 训练前补剂叠乘，默认同时生效时为20倍。仅单人。
